\n\nご検討のほど、どうぞよろしくお願い申し上げます。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pokemaru06/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e561bcca/uploads/origins/48ba195f-cdf9-4068-967d-4b087854159e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c2aa7f17c3674254921f454eb29918d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e561bcca/uploads/origins/48ba195f-cdf9-4068-967d-4b087854159e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c2aa7f17c3674254921f454eb29918d, https://si.imgix.net/e561bcca/uploads/origins/48ba195f-cdf9-4068-967d-4b087854159e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ad2ed47ee5a56b072096f5f5e3f8e6a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e561bcca/uploads/origins/48ba195f-cdf9-4068-967d-4b087854159e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75d3428964deaa0a11bcd4db95d998ea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作風が好きです。\nVtuberのMono Monetのファンアートをお願いしたいのですが、好きなように描いてください！\n\n好きなように描いてください\n\n以下、彼女のリファレンスシートの画像です。\nhttps://twitter.com/mono_monet/status/1744983048503115942", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pokemaru06/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/38e0bc6a/uploads/origins/98f8b855-9883-4cb4-a240-855b4089003a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77fdb15fb9e84d73179e4c10776d9413", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38e0bc6a/uploads/origins/98f8b855-9883-4cb4-a240-855b4089003a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=77fdb15fb9e84d73179e4c10776d9413, https://si.imgix.net/38e0bc6a/uploads/origins/98f8b855-9883-4cb4-a240-855b4089003a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23395d331bf9f52de31ea9ec5e97cd0c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38e0bc6a/uploads/origins/98f8b855-9883-4cb4-a240-855b4089003a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=062a547b6cc